<title>USA: Odyssey Partners cuts Telemundo stake.</title>
<headline>Odyssey Partners cuts Telemundo stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Odyssey Partners L.P. said Wednesday it reduced its stake in Telemundo Group Inc to the equivalent of 422,711 series A shares or 6.3 percent of the class outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the New York-based investment firm said it sold 107,500 shares between September 13 and 30 at prices ranging from $29.96 to $34.99 a share.</p>
<p>Odyssey said its stake in Telemundo includes 273,671 series B shares convertible into series A shares.</p>
</text>
